block head
    title Obesity - Plants Cause Disease

block content
    h1 Obesity
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/obesity/symptoms-causes/syc-20375742") Mayo Clinic]:
    blockquote Obesity is a complex disease involving having too much body fat. Obesity isn't just a cosmetic concern. It's a medical problem that increases the risk of many other diseases and health problems. These can include heart disease, diabetes, high blood pressure, high cholesterol, liver disease, sleep apnea and certain cancers.
